    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "AUCTION 8TH OCTOBER 2026 AT 12.30PM......Nestled along the stunning Waterford coastline, Guileen Cottages offer a rare opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented coastal home in an area of outstanding natural beauty. Overlooking rolling green fields that gently meet the rugged shoreline, this charming property combines peaceful countryside living with breathtaking sea views.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is thoughtfully laid out across two floors and extends to approximately 804 sq. ft. The ground floor features a bright and welcoming open-plan living space, seamlessly connecting the living room, kitchen, and dining area. This modern yet cozy space is enhanced by clean finishes, a stylish breakfast bar, and abundant natural light. A well-proportioned bedroom and a bathroom complete the ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers two additional bedrooms, including a spacious primary bedroom, along with a second bathroom and hallway. The layout is practical and inviting, ideal for family living or as a tranquil holiday retreat.\r\n\r\nExternally, the setting is truly exceptional. Positioned just moments from the water’s edge, the property enjoys panoramic coastal views, with scenic walking routes and unspoiled landscapes right on your doorstep. The surrounding area of Ardmore is renowned for its peace, privacy, and natural charm, making it an ideal escape from the hustle and bustle of everyday life.\r\n\r\nGuileen Cottages present a perfect blend of modern comfort and coastal serenity, offering a unique opportunity to own a slice of Ireland’s spectacular coastline.\r\n\r\nAuctioneers Comments: This property is offered for sale by online auction (unless sold prior) so please contact us early to avoid disappointment. The successful bidder is required to pay a 10% deposit and contracts are signed immediately on acceptance of a bid. Please note this property is subject to an undisclosed reserve price. Terms and conditions apply to this sale."
      },
      {
